{"about_the_game":"You are a child of the Void. But before stepping into the abyss, you must discover where this path begins.<br><br>In the demo, you will witness the beginning of the story, when the hammer still rings in the village, and the shadows of the past only start reaching for you. Here there is no heroism, only the first taste of power and the chill of cursed lands.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What\u2019s available in the demo:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>The beginning of the story \u2013 learn where the path of the embodiment begins.<br></li><li>First steps of power \u2013 level up your character up to level 5.<br></li><li>Village refuge \u2013 use the forge, trade with the merchant, brew potions, and buy runes from the rune master.<br></li><li>Several first locations \u2013 the first lands where the living have long since found no peace.</li></ul><br><br>This is a glimpse into the beginning of the story.<br>Here, you first step into a world where even death finds no rest. Here, it is not your fate that is decided, but the fate of all that still breathes in these lands.","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4026130?t=1757959986","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026130/cd6be651cc25c6726b29e5013958f29604f2e24e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757959986","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026130/fd31c2ef316f3a8c4a1d08f15e2b79ebf7f0c9b1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757959986","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026130/fd31c2ef316f3a8c4a1d08f15e2b79ebf7f0c9b1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757959986","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","